{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/17371-rumours-on-the-twilight-network","id":17371,"title":"Rumours on the Twilight Network","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Geist: The Sin-Eaters"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-24T16:27:23-08:00","id":17371,"title":"Rumours on the Twilight Network","content":"So I'm thinking I might sprinkle my GMC-Geist with rumours, anyone want to write some? (If you can do accents that would be cool)<br /> <br /> I'll get started.<br /> <br /> <br /> Trust me man, Krewes that try to muscle in on drug turf end up dead.<br /> Hades cut a deal with the Greeks, any day now they'll find enough oil to end that recession.<br /> The Government is after me man! I got proof they used zombies in 'nam and broke like a shitton of secret treaties.<br /> The Domains are the parts of Earth God decided wern't good enoguh. Think about it, what teaches you more: ten commandments or ten million abandoned commandments?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T16:36:49-08:00","id":17376,"title":"","content":"The Bargain is self-perpetuating, and it does have a cost. Yes, more than just listening to your geist ringing in your ear. When we die the last death, when our time is finally up, the body is left with our geist in it, but we \u2014 we leave a geist ourselves. Not a ghost. The deaths that touched you in life, the plasm you've harvested from low places, the anchors that weigh you to the Underworld, they all drag your identity down until you become something different from human, different from the human dead. I'm just saying, man. Treat geister well, lest you be treated in turn.<br /> <br /> They're performing experiments on plasm in some university outside of San-Fran. I hear they've developed a lab mouse that can cause poltergeist phenomena. It just does it to open cage doors and get to food, but who knows what's the next step?<br /> <br /> The Russian government accidentally struck a mine so deep they entered the Autochthonous Depths. If you ever visit the dead realms in Siberia, watch out for the Bratva running labor schemes on the poor ghosts there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T21:27:57-08:00","id":17502,"title":"","content":"You know when you were a kid and you did spooky shit at sleepovers? Like Bloody Mary and all that. Most of them are harmless, I know, but there's a new one that's popped up lately. They call it The Midnight Man, and it's kind of a hide-and-seek with (depending on who you ask), either an old pagan god, a demon, or some kind of very ancient ghost. You do some sort of little ritual, and then he stalks you around the house. You carry a lit candle; if he blows it out, he's &quot;tagged&quot; you, and you either die or experience your worst nightmares until sunrise. For some reason, I don't think this one's bullshit. It's too ornate, and a few stupid kids've gone missing.<br /> <br /> (You can google the Midnight Man game; it's creepy stuff. In my game, it was a Changeling - a young Scarecrow Minister - but it could easily be an old ghost, a Slasher, or some kind of ghost, somehow Anchored to the ritual instead of an object.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T13:43:17-08:00","id":17904,"title":"","content":"*curls up on atamajakki's head while he idly traces out his contribution(s) onto the thread....*<br /> <br /> 1. &quot;LFG: Three-Rivers-Pass. Wanting a bushel of The Ashen Tree's white-apples for research. Need Exp.Scout, Tank, and Heals. Have {Field Codex} for Rivers 1 &amp; 2. No info beyond 3. Serious inquiries only. (555-555-2300)<br /> <br /> 2. &quot;My Big Brother just told me that if you can swallow three grams of sea salt that's been &quot;soaking&quot; with some cremated remains for three days, you can summon Yella'Bones from Downstairs. Gonna try it t'nite with my gurl.&quot;<br /> <br /> 3. &quot;Word's on the street about the Black Cat's; they say that if those 'Sankys' path crosses yours, they don't even talk; they just fuck up your life. Only Bound need worry though; I don't think they mess with the Flesh.&quot;<br /> <br /> 4. &quot;You wan' a Cross dat' protectja' from deh Dead? Getja' some two nails from adka' coffin dat's bin'n deys ground for Tin Yeahs'; den bine'it togetta wit' Three Haih's fromja'own hayd'. Werks so'longs dem haih's dun break.&quot;<br /> <br /> 5. &quot;I heard that hopscotch started from back in Rome; and they used to make squares around the dead before they did in the body, see? All the Family had to be there; dead ones too. (They had to get the remains, or keep some on hand: nasty business!) And you hopped around them dead things until you closed the circle. (To symbolize the A-gate.) If anyone tripped up, or screwed the pooch on their hops, it's said the dead family member would haunt their ass.&quot;<br /> <br /> *slides down, and sk'daddles*<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1219-shake","name":"Shake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1219_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T14:08:53-08:00","id":17919,"title":"","content":"You know that Death is like gravity, right? Like, the &quot;deader&quot; you are, the lower you sink. The whole underworld is built in that principle. Gravity works on mass- the bigger you are, the stronger you pull others to you. Death works the same, but only with age instead of mass. Now, if black holes are just chunks of mass which become so big that they collapse into themselves because of their own gravity, it means that if something old enough it will become something similar, right? Like, a necrotic black hole.<br /> <br /> And just like that there is a giant black hole in the middle of our galaxy, there is something similar in the bottom of the underworld. You can throw anything into there, and it would instantly vanish without any remain- it even destroy the history of the thing! Sure, if you come too close to it it will eat you up- but there are ceremonies and Avernian gates which allow one sided connection to it. The nice thing about it is that you can even throw metaphysical things into that place- like, If you write down a memory and throw it inside, you will forget it. You can also scream your name into there, and no one will remember it. Nightmares, fears, hopes, identity, connections to others- there is a ceremony or a gate for everything. It is just like a big garbage can. Because of that, those who know about that black hole call it &quot;Oblivion&quot;.<br /> <br /> However, one thing makes me thinking- I've heard that there is a theory that one day, after absorbing enough mass, a black hole will start to throw up everything it swallowed until it will vanish. If that Oblivion is the same as black holes- I wonder what will happen when it will start to &quot;throw up&quot; all the garbage we fed it through all of those years...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":503,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","user":"LostLight","date":". 11-26-2013, 03:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T09:16:56-08:00","id":18448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/17371-rumours-on-the-twilight-network?p=17919#post17919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because of that, those who know about that black hole call it &quot;Oblivion&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Love it. Just fantastic and compelling.<br /> Will absolutely assimiliate in my upcoming chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}